# Specify files that shouldn't be modified by Fern
#
# Auth options — manually maintained for dual-header auth (v1.0).
# The Fern overlay in services/backend/fern/sdk-overlays.yml declares
# the dual-header scheme so a clean regeneration produces the same
# code, but pinning here protects the manual edits if generator
# behaviour changes.
core/request_option.go
option/request_option.go
option/credentials_test.go
MIGRATION.md
CHANGELOG.md
